{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9qyUas0h_qDzWrzpaHXbMw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:21.444344+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9qyUas0h_qDzWrzpaHXbMw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aV2cOsO5EJR0riaWGuu8ic9J1SSTaKaRiakQvnxX0ArY75tQd0NaU3I9sFKLhlf7v7TTY6NVrPksyegVkseZYiaX2VYK0ibYzHzia8v7yuWibaAYWc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aV2cOsO5EJSk39XjErmiaF2VO7LsFwicptdGtlYGF7TN8dZoX5JnEOHYIsjj9Fua04ibTW4eX813sF0WDSqvNS6PZeIoSYu5bbQnL1ibIkQyiafU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span>湖南大学土木工程学院办学历史可溯源至创办于1903年的湖南省垣实业学堂路科，时至今日，湖南大学土木工程学院已经走过120余年光辉历程，为国家和社会培养了包括13位两院院士及7位国家工程设计、监理大师在内的40000余名土木英才，享有较高的学术地位和优良的社会声誉，正朝着建设“世界一流学科”的目标砥砺奋进。</span></p><p><span>学院竭诚欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试来我校攻读研究生。为做好</span><strong><span><span>2027年推荐免试研究生</span></span></strong><span>（含直博生）接收工作，现将预报名有关事宜通知如下。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2.2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></p><p><span>3.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>4.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、招生专业</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>接收类型包括推荐免试硕士研究生和直接攻读博士研究生。所有全日制招生专业均接收推荐免试硕士研究生和直接攻读博士研究生。</span></p><p><span>我校硕士研究生基本学制为2-3年，具体以当年度专业培养方案为准。直博生基本学制为5年。</span></p></section><section><p><span>我院以下专业接收推免生：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aV2cOsO5EJTEF2HMbwahYlLU1t10VNtLsG8Hqt2XvOkL8GiaEcLWUnpOwRCGB5hKVicH1MKIBkJkYhoR9T72ZAe50BibO0tIt6HApjNthelVnc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>注：招生专业以教育部推免系统公布的推免招生专业目录为准；有意向从事土木工程建造和管理、防灾减灾及防护工程方向或者建筑材料方向的应届推免生请报考[081400]土木工程专业中的结构工程方向或[085900]土木水利专业中的土木工程专业，并在推免复试前登记备注。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.报名截止时间：2026年9月13日14:30；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.申请人8月28日起可登录湖南大学接收推免生报名信息采集系统，填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学院将分批审核申请信息，根据相关政策组织开展考核选拔工作；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.申请人须在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”正式报名，完成填报志愿、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>四、申请材料</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人将以下材料按照1-5项顺序整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M），上传推免生报名信息采集系统。</span></p></section><section><p><span><span>1.个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明(由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章)；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.英语水平证明材料（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS成绩单等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>五、注意事项</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.我校推免生报名信息采集系统中的招生专业仅供参考，具体推免生招生专业以公布的2027年研究生推免招生专业目录为准，最终录取专业以“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”中录取确认为准；</span></p><p><span>2.直接攻读博士研究生招生专业、导师名单可参考《湖南大学2026年博士研究生招生专业目录》。如对招生专业、报考博士生导师等信息有疑问，可在报名阶段咨询相关学院；</span></p><p><span>3.“工程硕博士培养改革专项计划”“国家优秀中小学教师培养计划”招生专业及申请要求详见后续发布的相关报名通知；</span></p><p><span>4.申请人应保证填报信息、申请材料的真实性和准确性。对于提供虚假报考信息或不符合申请条件的考生，一经查实，取消申请资格、考核资格等；</span></p><p><span>5.我校研究生教育实行收费制度，各招生专业学费标准以公布为准；</span></p><p><span>6.我校已构建完备的研究生奖助体系，支持研究生顺利完成学业。各类奖助学金评选发放标准以入学当年学校通知为准；</span></p><p><span>7.研究生院网站将及时发布学校2027年接收推免生招生信息，如上级部门出台新的招生政策，我校将做相应调整并及时予以公布。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aV2cOsO5EJQEvIjDv2ibqBibrzAnUv86kkUQHcWfUcBk2sIPPu7hRiaz9aVlv2tQTtkiaC8oHt6iakzz98egANpj8EpVE5RJgtuOGZ2icUs4mtqw8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span>文章来源丨湖南大学研究生院</span></p><p><span><span>编辑丨李佳豪</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审丨王</span><span><span>王</span></span><span>征</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审丨张家辉</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审丨李绍斌</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aV2cOsO5EJRA9ib9ESXhfkaZib1kLXu51wibwgfSbE2ib3he5Dpibicl7MlFXvAuJat4uf8v6Rw3tbVBPAbI5AR37AU5ZWdBG8pg9jrIHM1VJXyYA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aV2cOsO5EJSWRrNsAYulrynuicwEEqD1mXqZhTiboMNA6ricozZicYyic9Y6e0jkSkXPDAx61yIYbaLk6051sCa3T7ZBQkZcMPVQxZkScehZGXYw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>扫描二维码</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>关注湖大土木官微</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a1c47c53049adf123a89582bc41a6c2bfd2d13caf1397354f5783433b3ef934c","textLength":1500,"sourceSha256":"105ec94975f7fd1f33012db9c998f01799afd639800ddc361a01cd376d18dcd2","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2c9699ccdb61d4b2708d","title":"2026年湖南大学土木工程学院预推免报名开始","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:21.444344+00:00"}
